# Scorch Theme - Red Dark Mode TCSS Styles

"""Red-themed dark terminal UI with high contrast for readability."""

background #0d0505;
surface #150808;
border normal #7a1c1c; border focused #ff4d4d;
text #f2dede; secondary #a06a6a; primary #e03131; highlight #ff6b6b;

# Colors for different states and elements
error #ff2a2a; warning #ffb86c; success #50fa7b; info #6272a4;

# Special surfaces for panels
panel-surface #1f0e0e; panel-focus #2a1313;

# Status bar colors
status-background #150808; status-text #a06a6a;

# Button states
button-normal background #1a0c0c text #f2dede; button-hover background #251111; button-focused background #3d1919 border focused #ff4d4d;
button-disabled background #0f0707 text #503636;

# Scrollbar styling
scrollbar-background surface scrollbar-border border;
scrollbar-thumb surface scroll-thin;

# Focus indicators
focus-ring 2px border-focused ring-inset transparent ring-offset-1px;

# Utility styles
mono font-family monospace size 14;
small text-size-80% secondary;
medium text-size-110%;
large text-size-130% primary;

# Panel styling (used everywhere)
panel border border normal border-thick surface;
panel-title border-top border-bottom border-style solid border-width 2px;
panel-title-text center large white;
